<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Numerical Results for the RLHF and Reranking Experiments</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Tables <a href="#A1.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ A.2 Numerical Results for the RLHF and Reranking Experiments ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Penalizing Length: Uncovering Systematic Bias in Quality Estimation Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ A.2 Numerical Results for the RLHF and Reranking Experiments ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Penalizing Length: Uncovering Systematic Bias in Quality Estimation Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.2 Numerical Results for the RLHF and Reranking Experiments ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Penalizing Length: Uncovering Systematic Bias in Quality Estimation Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.2 Numerical Results for the RLHF and Reranking Experiments ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Penalizing Length: Uncovering Systematic Bias in Quality Estimation Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> present the numerical results for the RLHF and Reranking experiments in Section <a href="#S3.SS4" title="3.4 Bias in Translation Length ‣ 3 Experiments ‣ Penalizing Length: Uncovering Systematic Bias in Quality Estimation Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.4</span></a> in the tables below. Numbers in brackets indicate the total number of instances.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T2" class="ltx_table">
